# Approved release signer certificate(s) — one SHA-256 digest per line (colons optional).
#
# Beta/stable publishes (publish-release.ps1) are fail-closed against this list: the APK's
# signer certificate MUST match one of these digests, so a wrong-keystore build can never
# ship and then silently block future in-place updates (Android accepts updates only from
# the installed certificate or a proven signing lineage).
#
# The certificate digest is PUBLIC information — it ships inside every signed APK.
# Update this list deliberately when rotating the release key (add the new digest, keep the
# old one while updates must stay installable).
#
# CN=Payanam (release keystore; used by current stable/beta builds)
